    m_Localized: Pick {0} to {1} viewers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606603
    m_Localized: That's not a valid choice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606604
    m_Localized: You can only recruit between streams.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606605
    m_Localized: Not available in this character set.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606606
    m_Localized: '{0} can''t be bought.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606607
    m_Localized: You already have {0} {1}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606608
    m_Localized: You can only upgrade between streams.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606609
    m_Localized: Your Sub Cap is maxed out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606610
    m_Localized: Nobody is waiting to join.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606611
    m_Localized: You've hit your Sub Cap. You'll have to deny them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606612
    m_Localized: There's nothing to decide.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606613
    m_Localized: Pick one of the revealed viewers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606614
    m_Localized: That viewer can't be replaced.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606615
    m_Localized: There's nobody to ban.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606616
    m_Localized: That viewer wasn't in the swatted stream.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606617
    m_Localized: Finish tonight's stream first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606618
    m_Localized: That was the final night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606619
    m_Localized: You're streaming without a streamer power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606620
    m_Localized: 'This power is passive: it''s always on.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606621
    m_Localized: Streamer powers are used in the shop, after your stream.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606622
    m_Localized: This power needs a rival to hit (multiplayer only).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606623
    m_Localized: 'Recharging: ready in {0} {0:plural:turn|turns}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606624
    m_Localized: Already armed for your next stream.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606625
    m_Localized: There's no next stream to use it on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606626
    m_Localized: There's no viewer in the shop to catch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606627
    m_Localized: Pick a rival who's still in the season.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606628
    m_Localized: That rival has no Cash to tax.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606629
    m_Localized: Automatic (your streamer's setup)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606630
    m_Localized: Evolving (grows with your Sub Cap)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606631
    m_Localized: The goal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606632
    m_Localized: 'Pull off one stream with <b>4 Diamond viewers in chat at the same
      time</b>, and end it successfully before your final night (25 by default).
      Recruiting four Diamonds isn''t enough: they have to show up together.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606633
    m_Localized: A night has two halves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606634
    m_Localized: <b>1. The stream.</b> Press <b>Add Viewer to Chat</b> to let the
      next viewer from your Audience join. Each viewer can join once per stream.
      Viewers with a purple <b>action</b> button can use it once per stream. When
      you're happy, press <b>End the Stream</b> to bank what everyone in chat brought
      in.\n<b>2. The shop.</b> Viewers bring in <color=#FFC94A>Subs</color>; when
      the stream ends they're banked as <color=#FFC94A>Gifted Subs</color>, which
      recruit new viewers into your Audience. <color=#6BE38B>Cash</color> raises
      your <b>Sub Cap</b> (how many viewers fit in chat at once).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606635
    m_Localized: Platform Ban Risk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606636
    m_Localized: 'Viewers with a red X add Platform Ban Risk. Up to 2 net Platform
      Ban Risk is fine; at <b>3 the stream gets a Platform Ban</b>: it ends with
      no payout and you give one viewer a <b>Temporary Ban</b> (they sit out the
      next stream). Normie, Die Hard Fan and Internet Starpower <b>cancel</b> 1 Platform
      Ban Risk each while in chat (Cheems does too when a Doge is around). Some viewers
      add Platform Ban Risk with their actions; This Is Fine Dog talks the platform
      out of one ban, and the Chat Arbitrator clears risk.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606637
    m_Localized: Sub Cap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606638
    m_Localized: You can't add viewers once you've hit your Sub Cap, but viewers
      who <b>bring</b> others (Marketing Manager, Online Scandal, Bigger Star) or
      take extra space (Big Chungus takes 3) can push you over it. If that happens
      the <b>server goes down</b> and the stream ends with no payout. Leave spare
      room!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606639
    m_Localized: Money
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606640
    m_Localized: 'Raising your Sub Cap costs 2 Cash, then 1 more each time (max 12
      per space, up to 34). Some viewers charge fees (negative Cash). Fees are paid
      from your Cash; any unpaid amount costs <b>7 Gifted Subs per Cash</b>.\nThe
      shop''s stock is <b>shared by every player</b>: each normal viewer has 4 copies
      for the whole match, and you can own at most 4 of each; Diamonds are unlimited.
      You can''t remove viewers from your Audience, so every recruit changes your
      odds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606641
    m_Localized: Actions and families
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606642
    m_Localized: Every viewer belongs to a group (Animal, Wojak, Rage Comic, Reaction,
      Brainrot, or TBD while it's still being decided) and every action has a type
      (Recruit, Remove, Modify, Shuffle, Scout, Economy). Doge loves mixed groups
      (TBD doesn't count), Bongo Cat buffs Animals and Dancing Baby rewards two actions
      of the same type in a row. Some actions ask you to pick an option first, then
      one or more viewers; actions that take several viewers show a Confirm button.
      Permanent changes (Chad vs Virgin, Tung Tung, Bad Luck Brian, Affiliate, Gen
      Z with Job) stay with that viewer card forever. Hover any viewer to see its
      group, action type and tonight's effects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606643
    m_Localized: Streamers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606644
    m_Localized: 'Before a season you <b>Select Your Streamer</b>. Each one has a
      power: <b>passive</b> powers are always on; <b>active</b> powers are used from
      the shop after your stream (on your turn), cost Cash, get more expensive every
      time you use them (like raising your Sub Cap) and may need a few turns to recharge.
      <b>Rival</b> powers (Raid, Wealth Tax) hit another player, so they only work
      in multiplayer. Pick <b>No Streamer</b> to play the classic rules. Your streamer
      also brings their own stream setup.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606645
    m_Localized: Controls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606646
    m_Localized: <b>Space</b> add viewer / confirm picks / next night   <b>E</b>
      end the stream   <b>R</b> Audience   <b>Esc</b> cancel / menu   <b>F11</b>
      fullscreen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606647
    m_Localized: Multiplayer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606648
    m_Localized: 'Everyone gets the same character set and starts with the same Audience,
      and everyone can watch every stream: click a player in the Players panel to
      see their board live. In <b>Take Turns</b> mode (the default) players stream
      one after another each night while everyone else watches what they point at,
      pick and buy, and the season ends after the first night someone pulls off a
      4-Diamond stream. The host can set a turn timer. In <b>Synchronized Nights</b>
      mode everyone plays the same night at once and the next night starts when every
      player is ready. In <b>Race</b> mode everyone plays at their own pace and the
      first 4-Diamond stream wins instantly. If nobody wins, the best Diamond count
      in a successful stream takes it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 483606649
    m_Localized: <b>Win:</b> 4 Diamonds in one successful stream.\n<b>Add Viewer:</b>
      the next viewer in the queue joins chat.  <b>End the Stream:</b> banks Subs
      as Gifted Subs, plus Cash.\n<b>3 net Platform Ban Risk</b> = Platform Ban (no
      payout, one viewer gets a Temporary Ban).\n<b>Over your Sub Cap</b> = Server
      Down (no payout).\n<b>Shop:</b> Gifted Subs recruit viewers (the stock is shared
      by every player), Cash raises your Sub Cap and pays for streamer actives.\n<b>Keys:</b>
      Space add viewer/confirm/next night, E end the stream, R Audience, Esc menu,
      F11 fullscreen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
